        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDLS480, Screen and Storm Door Latch Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSolid brass tubular storm or screen door lever and latch set with contemporary rectangular back plates. It can be used for wood or metal screen doors and storm doors. Fits doors 7/8\" to 1-3/8\" thick. Manufactured by Deltana, the architectural hardware manufacturer with a proven record for exceptional service and quality. All brass construction, available in your choice of 5 popular finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDLS480-Specifications.gif?v=1704354569\" width=\"600\" height=\"258\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SDLS480 Screen Door Latch Set Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDLS480 Storm Door Latch Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for doors 7/8\" - 1-3/8\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy button locks spindle & latch bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible handling.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDLS480.pdf?v=1691095375\" target =\"new\"><b>Deltana SDLS480 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
